// BT-4290: runs a block in this class's own class process.

Object subclass: Bt4290Runner
  // ADR 0142 (BT-4300): class state keeps this class's methods in its class
  // process, which is what these rows exercise; a stateless class's methods
  // run in the caller.
  classState: pinned = 0

  class run: blk => blk value
